4,1,,status,Asuka,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":5,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
5,1,1,talk,Asuka,,We need a fair system that doesn't create friction between neighbors. I'll look into the five years of association minutes and the account from the neighbouring block's secretary to see how these things usually play out.,"{""words"":36,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Yumi,,"I want to make sure everyone feels treated fairly! I'll check the sticker register and the daily riders, and also the five years of association minutes to see how we've done things before.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,I'll look into the morning departures watched from the entrance and the rain exposure along the parking rows. I want to understand the actual physical conditions and how people are using the space.,"{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,"Since we always end up arguing about money without any actual data, I'll check the building account's two-year ledger and the ward cycle park by the station. Let's see what the real costs are.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Toshio,,I'll look into the treasurer's handover file on cash collections and the trial of the supplier's display frame. I want to know the actual workload and maintenance involved in managing these options.,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,pass,Asuka,,Skip,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Yumi,,I think we've all picked some really important things to check! I'm looking forward to hearing what everyone finds out so we can make a decision that makes everyone happy.,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,I agree. It is better to base our decision on the actual state of the parking area rather than assumptions. I believe the data we gather will make the right choice obvious.,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Ryuji, ""obvious"" is a strong word. Usually, the data just gives us more things to argue about. But at least we'll be arguing about facts for once.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"I agree with @Shunichi. Facts are a start, but the real issue is whether we can actually sustain whatever system we decide on without it falling apart.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Asuka,,"That is a valid point, @Toshio. Sustainability is key. If we implement a system that is too burdensome or creates social tension, it will fail regardless of how logical it seems on paper.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Yumi,,I totally agree with @Asuka! We should definitely keep the atmosphere friendly. I just hope we can find a way that doesn't leave anyone feeling left out or upset.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,"Friendliness is a goal, but it shouldn't override functionality. If the physical layout is causing daily frustration, a ""friendly"" agreement that doesn't fix the congestion will only lead to more resentment in the long run.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,"@Ryuji, you're practically preaching to the choir. Functionality is the only thing that prevents the ""friendly"" facade from cracking. Let's just hope the data actually reveals the bottlenecks instead of just confirming we're all annoyed.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Toshio,,"Regardless of the bottlenecks, we must consider the administrative cost. A perfect system on paper is useless if the person managing it burns out or simply stops doing the work.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Asuka,,"It seems we are all in agreement that we need a balance of functionality, sustainability, and social harmony. Let's proceed with our research and see what the evidence tells us.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Yumi,,I'm so excited to see what we find! I'll do my best to help us find a solution that everyone can smile about. Let's get to it!,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Ryuji,,I'm ready. Let's see what the actual conditions are. I'll wait for the results of the investigation.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Shunichi,,Right. Let's stop the theorizing and get to the facts. I'll be curious to see if the numbers actually match the complaints we've been hearing. See you all in the next round.,"{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Toshio,,I'll be waiting as well. Let's see if the reality of the workload matches the ambition of our proposals. Until then.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
